The '''Evergreen Plateau''' is a sub-location of the [[Moonglade Marsh]].

== Features ==
The '''Evergreen Plateau''' is a large field with [[Fig Log|Fig Tree]]s to chop. Additionally, [[Lushlilac|Lushlilac Bushes]] can be picked for {{Item|Lushlilac}}.

=== Auryon ===
{{Main|Auryon}}
{{NPCSprite|Auryon}} introduces the player to [[Hunting#Forest Hunting|Forest Hunts]] and gives them an {{Item|Abysmal Lasso}}.

